              This operation is available only if  the  kernel  is  configured
              with CCOONNFFIIGG__SSEECCCCOOMMPP enabled.

              The value of _f_l_a_g_s must be 0, and _a_r_g_s must be NULL.

              This operation is functionally identical to the call:

